across time  and space awaits you in this rpg gotcha  mobile game with many unique and very  cute characters to collect and battle  with and it's available for ios and  android devices link in the description  from wolf waifus to cute pepper girls  yes that's right this game is creative  enough to have a leaper based on red  peppers and she's adorable by the way  space sleeper is filled with such  amazing diverse character designs which  are coupled with unique and engaging  personality in fact space sleeper  partnered with vtuber doranana who is  based on space sleeper's protagonist  doranana not only looks super cute but  appreciates the greatness of coffee as i  learned in her q a video which means a  lot to a caffeine dependent light form  like myself the game boasts formidable  rogue-like gameplay and i love to see  the cute characters using their cool and  unique moves to defeat the opposing  forces in space sleeper cocoon cosmic  radiation caused transformations of the  creatures and objects and now you can  enjoy all of these cute characters in  pixel perfect 2d yes this game looks  great all around for me it's always fun  seeing the creative designs and guessing  what animal or object was transformed to  create each whether it's the lion based  leonlev the cat based doranana or the  wolf-based amber you got a ton to choose  from when building your own cute but  deadly squad the mobile experience is  also available on every screen allowing  you to see your to quote  pretties on whatever device you have at  hand so what are you waiting for support  the channel by downloading slc and  assembling your own squad right now use  the code leap2u for 10 free draws so  back to yamato as i was saying she drops  a bombshell a big one kinamon and momo  say what in surprise asking if she's  really not heading out to see and yamato  answers nope she's staying she's even  already spoken to luffy and the others  about it kinamon and momo make it clear  that she's welcome to stay but they're  just confused after all a moment ago she  said she'd made up her mind that she was  going and the reason is funny you may  think she's finally decided to choose  her own way rather than to follow odin's  example but no it's just the opposite in  fact she says odin started his journey  with a tour of wano so she's going to do  that because that would be more odin  right now than going off to see so  that's a pretty hilarious reason not to  go however she adds she's sure that  she'll find her way if she follows in  odin's footsteps and she's bound to make  it to c sooner or later which to me is  probably referring to the final big war  where luffy will need everyone he met  along the way to assist him momo for his  part is hilariously shocked that she had  the time to explain all this while luffy  and the straw hats didn't even say bye  to him so let's talk about this  practically everyone was saying that  yamato already joined the straw hats or  was joining the straw hats and was going  to be luffy's final 10th crewmate and  that by the way that 10 number is not  counting luffy himself and some people  even thought that the last chapter  confirmed she would be joining but the  whole time i've been saying if you look  at all the past trapped reviews i've  been saying i won't believe it until she  set sail with them and wanna was no  longer in sight and here i'm personally  not surprised to see that yamato has not  joined although it would have been  pretty cool if she did i get why some  people would be surprised though because  oda was purposely teasing the idea  pretty hard right up to the last chapter  luffy wanted yamato yamato said she's in  the crew and then in the last chapter  she said she's going to the straw hats  but as i said before yamato has the  guardian deity of wano fruit where does  that belong in wano protecting wano  furthermore her friendship with momo was  consistently emphasized and built up  foreshadowing that they would continue  to be there for one another as guardians  of wano plus wano needs all the  firepower it can get right now and  yamato is a strong force that could even  hold back kaido albeit temporarily so it  makes sense that she'd stay lastly when  it was revealed that we already have a  mythical zone on the crew namely luffy  it took some of the luster from straw  hat candidate yamato since we were no  longer missing a rare mythical zone  member to have on the crew so i don't  actually think people should be too  surprised by this even if oda did try  pretty hard to trick everyone into  thinking that yamato would be the final  crew member but let me know your  thoughts on this are you happy or sad do  you get why yamato didn't become a straw  hat or is it an upsetting twist for you  so back to momo being mad because he  feels disrespected by luffy since his  friend didn't bid him a proper farewell  he recalls all their history and how  luffy brought out the best in him helped  him to become a man pretty much he  remembers how luffy made it possible for  them to do the impossible to beat kaido  and to save the people of wana momo  continues to get himself more and more  angry as he rushes towards luffy he says  luffy is mistaking being free which is  luffy's main thing with being free to be  rude i love this little clash here  between luffy's ideology and the proper  etiquette associated with samurai  culture momo even looks to kinemon to  fire him up even more as kinemon says  he's not wrong kinemon even says he may  have no choice but to cleave luffy apart  depending on his words and momo agrees  with only yamato being like yeah you  guys are blowing this out of proportion  now we jump to kidlaw and luffy lost his  stuff that's just become a thing pirates  say to each other he says remember the  next time we meet it'll be as enemies  don't whine to me if we're shooting to  kill and luffy says gotcha it's like  what shanks and buggy said to each other  when they were apprentice pirates but  when they finally met up they were still  friends i'm sure it'll be the same for  luffy and law finally momo and yamato  arrived momo bearing fangs while yamato  is smiling and waving saying they've  come to see them off momo tackles luffy  still angry but he quickly goes from a  scary intimidating face to bawling his  eyes out saying please don't leave i'll  be lonely it's a hilarious twist that  isn't hard to predict when you remember  how young momo actually is on the inside  all his anger up to this point was  really just covering up his sadness momo  says he was able to survive because of  luffy he can laugh again and avenge his  mother and father because of luffy even  a smiling zorro calls it a pitiful sight  but everyone is okay with it because  nami says he's still a little kid luffy  explains that they are still here  because they were waiting to give momo  this he gives him a straw hat pirate  flag and calls momo his little brother  so it's mirroring how odin was a little  brother to whitebeard and arguably to  roger as well luffy says the flag will  let people know that messing with their  friends is the same as messing with the  straw hats it's so hype and cool that  luffy has put wano under his protection  and it's exactly what needed to happen  to make me believe that wanna will  actually be okay without him here with  this and yamato staying i feel like wano  is in a solid position and i think oda  did that well when momo asks if he's one  of them luffy says that if any one of  them wants to be a pirate he'll comfort  them right away he just says he won't  have weak links on board which is  classic luffy and then momo starts  acting tougher right away yamato is told  to take care of them and the straw hat  set sail as momo the shogun bows down to  the ground as far as he can go to show  his deep respect and gratitude to luffy  and the others momo promises to kinemon  that he will surpass odin and kinemon  agrees saying he'll be by his side when  that happens we get a hilarious comic  relief moment of yamato saying are you  talking about me and they both scream  out no  so it's good to see that we're still  going to get yamato being odin slash not  being odin jokes we get another great  moment between these three captains  before they part ways the smart way to  leave wano is to use the lift that  lowers ships but since kidd says only  wusses do that luffy and law decide  they'll all take the dangerous route of  just rushing down i will definitely miss  this dynamic i gotta say the narrator  calls these three the real life wisdom  kings and says their power descended  like a wrathful tsunami obliterating all  its path even kaido the dragon king and  the yokai possessed giant oyrun failed  to withstand their assault the heavens  themselves were torn as painful shrieks  verbatid through the air so that's how  our pirate boys will be remembered in  mono history as powerful wisdom kings  which is pretty cool we then go back to  the performance where hiori and orochi  are being talked about we hear how  orochi was thwarted by denjiro odin's  second disciple after orochio nigashima  and kaido fell the sun had finally  pierced the dark clouds that were  suffocating wano for 20 long years the  skies were clear hiyori is given a  special role in this performance no  longer having to bite her tongue as she  did in the last 20 years she says to  orochi the kurozumi which means charcoal  were born to burn mirroring odin's born  to boil quote the crowd goes crazy this  is some of that hollywood movie touch to  make the legend a bit more cinematic and  perfect then we fast forward to the day  after the festival and we're told the  violence saga has now become a joyous  reunion and we're told that is the  conclusion of today's tale on our  nation's renowned samurai we see a  picture of momo the scabbards and other  wano heroes smiling the curtain closes  on wano as momo is wondering where to  put luffy's flag and we're told  inherited will never fades a  long-running theme in the one piece  story for now at least wano gets a break  after so much war and misery luffy and  friends have freed yet another place  successfully and now that one was done  people can finally rate it as a  standalone arc so let me know what would  you give it out of 10 and is it your  favorite arc if not which ones do you  prefer yes one was long very long but it  also had some of the most hyped one  piece moments ever so i'm not  complaining chill the parking within and  smash that like button with no mercy if  you enjoyed this video be a smashing  pirate king rather than a passing orochi  and youtube will reward you with wano  fireworks celebrating this long arc's  conclusion make this the video subscribe  if you haven't already and hit that  notification bell turn on all  notifications or you will miss future  one-piece reviews and updates and while  you wait for the next chapter to drop  feel free to check out my growing one  piece playlist that includes videos on  all the admirals mythical zones yonko  and much more link to that is in the  description and on screen right now and  until next time see ya space cowboys

